		<h3 class="newsType">
			<span class="jq-newsType"><span class="jq-trans" data-trid="e4db09f7-818d-4c56-9b66-2f4ebb848f66">Press release</span></span>


		</h3>
		
	</header>

	<div class="bodyContent pressreleaseContent">

		
<header><div class="topbar"><div class="leftcorner"></div><div class="rightcorner"></div><div class="middle"><span class="date" content="2026-10-20T18:21:09.4870000" itemprop="datePublished">10/20/2026</span><div class="rightfade"></div><div class="title"></div></div></div></header> 

		<div class="pressreleaseContentInner jq-pressreleaseContentInner">

			


			



			<div class="text hoverTrigger2">

				


				<h1 itemprop="name headline">The first public demo for <em>ReBlade: The Death Spiral,</em> a cyberpunk action game, is now available during Steam Next Fest!</h1>

					<h2>Welcome to a dystopian cyberpunk future infused with Chinese mythology. A world populated by machine-distorted, ancient creatures. Where individuals like yourself have access to all sorts of weapons, chips, augments, and yet are foredoomed.</h2>

				<section class="bodytext" itemprop="articleBody">
					<p><span><span><span><strong>October 20<sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</sup>, Singapore.</strong></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><strong>Dare to change your destiny. Embark on a journey to freedom while</strong> <strong>carving a bloody path to victory. Try to break The Death Spiral and unravel the truth hidden in this disturbing world.</strong></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span>Watch <em>ReBlade: The Death Spiral</em> Demo Trailer <a class="gp-autolink" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?reload=9&amp;v=Jd1-PALI6fg" target="_blank">HERE</a>.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span>Download the free demo available for the first time ever directly from Steam (<a class="gp-autolink" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3489340/ReBlade_The_Death_Spiral/" target="_blank"><span>https://store.steampowered.com/app/3489340/ReBlade_The_Death_Spiral/</span></a></span>). The demo will remain available not only during Steam Next Fest starting on October 19, but you&rsquo;ll also be able to enjoy it up until November 10!</span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><strong>ABOUT <em>REBLADE: THE DEATH SPIRAL</em></strong></span></span></span><br />
<span><span><span>In <em>ReBlade: The Death Spiral,</em> you are trapped in an endless cycle of death and rebirth. Fight your way through a futuristic city and uncover the truth behind the cycle as you search for a way to break free.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><strong><em>REBLADE: THE DEATH SPIRAL </em>&ndash; MAIN FEATURES</strong></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style="text-align:justify"><span><span><span><strong>Explore a Stylish Cyberpunk World </strong>&ndash; fight your way out from the dark underground into a sprawling neon-lit city, with polished environments and fluid animations bringing the world to life.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style="text-align:justify"><span><span><span><strong>Play as a Condemned Synthetic </strong>&ndash; play as a a stylishly designed heroine, with different outfits to unlock along the way.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style="text-align:justify"><span><span><span><strong>Hard-Hitting Combat </strong>&ndash; face deadly mechanical beasts inspired by Chinese mythology, learn their movesets, time your parries, and break their guard to unleash powerful attacks.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style="text-align:justify"><span><span><span><strong>Shape Your Build </strong>&ndash; experiment with weapons, skills, chips, and augments to create powerful combinations and discover new ways to fight with each run.</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p><br />
<span><span><span><em><span lang="EN">ReBlade: The Death Spiral </span></em><span lang="EN">is being developed by ChillyRoom and will be published on Steam by Spiral Up Games.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><span lang="EN">For more information</span>,<span> follow the game on </span><a class="gp-autolink" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3489340/ReBlade_The_Death_Spiral/" target="_blank"><span>Steam</span></a><span>, </span><a class="gp-autolink" href="https://x.com/ReBladeG" target="_blank"><span>X</span></a>, <a class="gp-autolink" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@rebladegame" target="_blank"><span>TikTok</span></a>,<span> and </span><a class="gp-autolink" href="https://www.instagram.com/rebladegame/" target="_blank"><span>Instagram</span></a><span>.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span><span><span><span lang="EN">________________________________________________________________________________________</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><strong><span lang="EN"><span><span>About ChillyRoom</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><span lang="EN"><span><span>ChillyRoom is based in Shenzhen, China. They are a team of talented, creative indie developers. Known for their roguelike dungeon crawlers such as <em>Soul Knight</em> and <em>Otherworld Legends</em>, they are continuously developing games in different genres with a single purpose &ndash; to bring fun and joy.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span><span><span><span lang="EN">________________________________________________________________________________________</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><strong><span lang="EN"><span><span>About Spiral Up Games</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span><span><span><span lang="EN"><span><span>Spiral Up Games is an international game publisher for high-quality PC indie games, headquartered in Singapore. Its team members comprise experienced game veterans with decades of experience in indie game development and marketing. Their mission is to find hidden gems of the indie market and polish them into shining diamonds so that they can be enjoyed and celebrated by gamers worldwide. For more information, visit </span></span></span><a class="gp-autolink" href="http://www.spiralupgames.com" target="_blank"><span><span>http://www.spiralupgames.com</span></span></a></span></span><span lang="EN"><span><span>. </span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>
				</section>
				<!-- /.bodytext -->

			</div>

